## ⚙️ Local Installation & Setup

If you want to run this project locally, follow these steps:

### 1. Clone the Repository
    bash
    git clone https://github.com/kiran-gunuru/eco-track.git
    cd eco-track
### 2. Run Backend
    Bash
    cd backend
    pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
    ### 3. Run Frontend
    Bash
    cd ../frontend
    npm install
    npm run dev
